.TH AGENT_BOARD 1 "2026-09-12" "agent_board" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agent_board.py \- live status board for coding agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent_board.py
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B agent_board.py
\fBnote\fR \fIACTION\fR [\fB\-m\fR \fIMSG\fR] [\fB\-\-pane\fR \fIID\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agent_board.py
renders a live status board with one vertical column per coding agent.
Agents register and post one-line statuses; herdr's api snapshot is the
source of truth for liveness (a column disappears the moment the agent's
pane closes). Columns are colored: green while working, yellow while
waiting for input, red when stopped by a rate/quota limit, cyan when idle.
.PP
Run \fBagent_board\fR (the wrapper) for the fullscreen TUI and service
management; \fBagent_board.py \-\-once\fR prints a single frame.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-once
Render one frame and exit (no curses).
.TP
.B \-\-compact
Compact layout: one line per agent, two columns.
.TP
.B \-\-poll\-period, \-\-autorefresh \fISECONDS\fR
Snapshot poll / frame autorefresh period (default: 2.0).
.TP
.B \-\-stale\-seconds \fISECONDS\fR
External card age before "stale" (default: 600).
.TP
.B \-\-herdr\-bin \fIBIN\fR
herdr binary for the liveness snapshot (default: \fBherdr\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Detailed colored help.
.SH NOTE ACTIONS
.TP
.B register
First post: opens the column (header = herdr tab title).
.TP
.B update
Replace the current status line only.
.TP
.B step
Replace the status line and append to the visible trail.
.TP
.B done
Mark the column done (✓ chip); line appended to the trail.
.TP
.B input
Waiting on the user: yellow chip; question/options go in the status
line and trail. Cleared automatically by the next step/update.
.TP
.B quota
Stopped by a rate/quota limit: red "stopped" chip; the status text gets
a live "Resets in d hh:mm:ss" countdown when \fB\-\-reset\fR is given
(ISO time, duration like \fB2d 3h\fR, or seconds). Cleared by the next
step/update.
.TP
.B stop
Remove your column (only needed outside herdr).
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Fullscreen board (q quits, j/k scrolls)
.B agent_board.py
.TP
Print a single frame
.B agent_board.py \-\-once
.TP
Open a column
.B agent_board.py note register \-m "refactoring auth module"
.TP
Ask the user (yellow chip)
.B agent_board.py note input \-m "A) keep B) revert?"
.TP
Report a quota stop with countdown
.B agent_board.py note quota \-m "Individual quota reached." \-\-reset 2d 3h
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/projects/agent_board/agent_board.py
The board source.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/agent_board/
Cards (one JSON per agent) and the rendered frame \fBboard.txt\fR.
.TP
.I ~/.config/systemd/user/agent_board.service
The systemd user unit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR agent_board (1),
.BR agent_watch (1),
.BR herdr (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Written for the Oh My Pi harness user.